From a5cb8e4ab49a0786600811ebde0b23789788a5d8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: coldshalamov <93robingattis@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 02:22:10 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] perf(render): quantize authored-instance camera cull dirty
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Chase follow micro-moves marked cameraDirty every frame (exact matrix
equality), forcing every active pool owner through syncOwnerSlots under
prepareFrame. Quantize translation to 0.25 WU and basis/projection to
1e-3 so quiet damping reuses the stable owner path; real pans/zooms
still dirty.

Portable pool sync ~2.32× (120 owners, 0.05 WU jitter; ownersVisited
~5.5× fewer). Picture ON; soft-GPU fps ignored. No master merge.
